ERC6909Premium_setOperator
├── when approved is true
│   └── it should set isOperator[msg.sender][operator] to true and emit OperatorSet
├── when approved is false
│   └── it should set isOperator[msg.sender][operator] to false and emit OperatorSet
├── when operator equals msg.sender
│   └── it should still succeed
└── when called twice with the same approved value
    └── it should be idempotent and still emit OperatorSet
